The prototype derives from the Apache-2.0 K6 port archived in iteration 016,
originally changh95/bevfusion-p150 revision
300095a42e61075a3d5c9916620344c1067200b8. Each source snapshot contains LICENSE
and NOTICE. Local changes add four calls with integer digit weights, FP32
product output and the incumbent reconstruction/epilogue. The separate BF16
weight diagnostic changes weight CB format, page size and reader transfer
sizes; it was not adopted. Kernel API and physical multicast guard changes
from iteration 016 remain. No original author endorsement is implied.
